## Checklist

Before deploying MongoDB configuration:

- [ ] `retryWrites=false` included in connection string
- [ ] `authSource` matches database where user was created
- [ ] Credentials are URL-encoded using `quote_plus()`
- [ ] Local MongoDB installation (not Docker) for development
- [ ] Database and user created in MongoDB Compass
- [ ] Connection tested with simple insert operation
- [ ] Indexes created on application startup
- [ ] Connection pooling configured appropriately
